From 3b00cc81e15b206396c6ed2205ec1134a86e850d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:05:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Pages: no polling from a hidden browser tab (102.8 line)

- The dashboard's timers, System Information, Warden, Dreadwatch, WPS and the Wallguard live view
  send no request while the tab is hidden and refresh once when it is shown again. Visible refresh
  rates are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp   | 14 +++++++-------
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_Dreadwatch.asp |  2 +-
